---
import { networkSites } from '../../data/network'

const year = new Date().getFullYear()
const links = networkSites.slice(0, 8)
---

<footer class="border-t-2 border-[var(--ink)]">
  <div class="hazard-stripe" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="barcode-strip" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container-app">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-12 border-x-2 border-[var(--ink)]">
      <div class="md:col-span-4 cell border-b-2 md:border-b-0 md:border-r-2 border-[var(--ink)]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <img src="/brand/mark.svg" alt="" width="28" height="28" />
          <span class="font-macro text-sm">JucheGang</span>
          <span class="structural-mark" aria-hidden="true">®</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-[var(--muted)] leading-relaxed text-body">
          The die is cast. Unity and AI for Korea and Canada. JPanda Network.
        </p>
        <p class="font-ko text-xs text-[var(--muted)] mt-2">주사위는 던져졌다</p>
        <p class="font-ko text-xs text-[var(--muted)] mt-3">한국과 캐나다를 잇는 통일과 인공지능</p>
      </div>

      <div class="md:col-span-4 cell border-b-2 md:border-b-0 md:border-r-2 border-[var(--ink)]">
        <p class="font-mono-ui text-[var(--hazard)] mb-4">[ Network ]</p>
        <ul class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-4 gap-y-2">
          {links.map(site => (
            <li>
              <a href={site.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-mono-ui text-[0.6rem] text-[var(--muted)] no-underline hover:text-[var(--hazard)] transition-colors duration-250">
                {site.name}
              </a>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="md:col-span-4 cell">
        <p class="font-mono-ui text-[var(--hazard)] mb-4">[ Connect ]</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li><a href="mailto:panda@juche.org" class="font-mono-ui text-[0.65rem] text-[var(--muted)] no-underline hover:text-[var(--ink)] transition-colors duration-250">panda@juche.org</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://t.me/tigerrising" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-mono-ui text-[0.65rem] text-[var(--muted)] no-underline hover:text-[var(--ink)] transition-colors duration-250">Telegram</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://instagram.com/jpandajames39" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-mono-ui text-[0.65rem] text-[var(--muted)] no-underline hover:text-[var(--ink)] transition-colors duration-250">Instagram</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="border-x-2 border-b-2 border-[var(--ink)] cell flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-start sm:items-center gap-4">
      <p class="font-mono-ui text-[var(--muted)] text-[0.6rem]">&copy; {year} JucheGang / JPanda Network</p>
      <nav aria-label="Legal" class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        <a href="/privacy" class="link-text">Privacy</a>
        <a href="/terms" class="link-text">Terms</a>
      </nav>
      <p class="font-mono-ui text-[var(--muted)] text-[0.6rem]">Victoria, BC / KC-01</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>